Z||000000||ChadMan||08-04-2000||01:36 PM||||From Brock Yates' column on <A HREF="http://www.speedvision.com:" TARGET=_blank>www.speedvision.com:</A> <P>"At this moment U.S. Customs in Los Angeles has locked up a pair of replica F50s built on Pontiac Fiero chassis. They are intended for use in a film being shot in Hong Kong, but the feds claim the cars are counterfeits and not only refuse to release them for shipment, but are threatening prosecution against the guys who fabricated them."<BR> <A HREF="http://www.speedvision.com/pub/articles/racing/08inews/000801a.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.speedvision.com/pub/articles/racing/08inews/000801a.html</A> ||||reg||8
