Z||000006||rockcrawl||08-06-2000||11:57 AM||||Most of the Ferrari replica manufacturers have been either put out of buisiness or driven underground by Ferrari. It can be difficult to find a replica of a newer model Ferrari. On the other hand, Lamborghini doesn't seem to care about replicas. I guess they are confident that their product is so much better, that they won't be losing any sales to kit cars. I'm currently building a Testarossa replica, and I already have several genuine Ferrari emblems for it. As long as I am not manufacturing and selling these cars, I don't think Ferrari can do a thing about it.<P>------------------<BR>Jon Lagler<BR>'86 GT 3800 (for sale)<BR>'87 GT (noisey 2.8)<BR>4.9 liter V8 Testarossa Spyder (under construction)||||reg||1
